    },
    {
      "name": "sdk_line_limit_discards_oversized_frames_without_poisoning_the_next_capture",
      "assessment": "Constructs valid JSON exceeding actual SDK DEFAULT_MAX_LINE_LENGTH. Both transports must deliver next request id2; full message value matches, bounded frame is true, protocol error absent and raw key order belongs to next frame. Then both end cleanly."
    },
    {
      "name": "raw_capture_limit_stays_stricter_than_the_sdk_line_limit",
      "assessment": "Uses real frame larger than 10MiB but smaller than 16MiB. SDK accepts its typed JSON and adapter preserves parsed value, while private capture explicitly denies it with unchanged 10485760-byte error and no key-order proof."
